<title>EGYPT: Egypt's Mohandes Bank results end-Q1 97.</title>
<headline>Egypt's Mohandes Bank results end-Q1 97.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results released at the end of the first three months of calendar 1997, the bank's financial year.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds, no comparative figures available):</p>
<p> Total assets		  2,102,299,000</p>
<p> Total deposits		1,555,333,000</p>
<p> Provisions			138,099,000</p>
<p> Reserves				105,000</p>
<p> Shareholders funds	     70,105,000</p>
<p> Distributable profits	  15,149,000</p>
<p>(Full name is Mohandes Bank )</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
